WEBVTT

01:30.840 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.080 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 19]

01:40.840 --> 01:42.000
Why didn't you go in?

01:42.229 --> 01:44.200
Weren't you going to win the championship?

01:44.200 --> 01:45.930
Isn't that the effeminate one?

01:47.070 --> 01:48.200
We went in,

01:48.710 --> 01:50.280
but the people inside had no taste
for good tea.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.120
It wasn't worth it,

01:51.120 --> 01:52.000
so we came out.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.590
Keep bragging!

01:53.710 --> 01:55.440
You got thrown out, didn't you?

01:55.560 --> 01:56.400
An.

01:59.560 --> 02:00.620
Come on, come here!

02:00.640 --> 02:01.530
Our lady

02:01.560 --> 02:03.350
would like to try your Orchid Snow tea!

02:03.350 --> 02:04.240
Is that okay?

02:04.840 --> 02:05.480
Coming!

02:06.280 --> 02:07.230
Pingyuan, Pingyuan,

02:07.230 --> 02:08.330
that man said that's their...

02:08.330 --> 02:09.789
Enough, no more nonsense.

02:11.700 --> 02:12.800
[Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association]

02:27.910 --> 02:29.030
The Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association

02:29.030 --> 02:30.360
presents Emei green tea

02:30.680 --> 02:32.280
for His Highness to taste.

02:33.800 --> 02:36.860
The Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association
presents tea!

02:41.950 --> 02:44.480
I'm Gu Pingyuan,
a tea merchant from Huizhou.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.430
May I ask

02:45.470 --> 02:46.930
how to address you, Madam?

02:47.560 --> 02:49.240
You are terribly impolite.

02:49.430 --> 02:51.690
Who do you think you're calling "Madam"?

02:52.360 --> 02:54.420
You carry yourself with noble grace,

02:54.960 --> 02:56.190
attended by a eunuch.

02:57.430 --> 02:59.520
If you're not a Princess Consort,
then you must be a Princess.

02:59.520 --> 03:00.430
In any case,

03:00.470 --> 03:02.360
you must be a high-ranking lady
of the Banner.

03:02.360 --> 03:03.490
I hope my assessment

03:03.520 --> 03:04.180
is correct.

03:04.870 --> 03:05.590
Clever.

03:05.910 --> 03:07.110
Then please proceed.

03:08.910 --> 03:10.170
Bring out our tea gear.

03:22.840 --> 03:23.780
Well, you two...

03:25.680 --> 03:27.360
You've brought so many utensils with you?

03:27.360 --> 03:28.430
A craftsman is only

03:28.520 --> 03:29.650
as good as his tools.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.190
It's just that we don't have water

03:31.190 --> 03:32.590
or charcoal for boiling.

03:33.870 --> 03:35.120
Eunuch, I wonder if you

03:35.120 --> 03:36.870
know anyone in the mansion

03:37.280 --> 03:38.840
who could lend us some.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.960
[Orchid Snow]

03:51.470 --> 03:52.280
Don't touch it.

03:52.280 --> 03:52.800
Hey, you!

03:52.800 --> 03:53.670
What are you doing?

03:53.670 --> 03:54.600
What do you want?

03:56.420 --> 03:58.550
First, I must apologize to you, Madam.

03:58.910 --> 04:00.640
I presume that you have

04:00.710 --> 04:01.910
some rouge or face powder

04:01.910 --> 04:03.840
on your hands and sleeves.

04:04.150 --> 04:05.680
I'm just afraid that
if those floral scents

04:05.680 --> 04:07.010
mix with the tea leaves,

04:07.110 --> 04:09.440
it will affect the tea's delicate flavor.

04:10.660 --> 04:12.500
You're so particular.

04:12.800 --> 04:13.430
Fine,

04:13.450 --> 04:14.470
I won't touch it.

04:14.710 --> 04:16.160
Madam, once you taste

04:16.160 --> 04:17.220
my Orchid Snow tea,

04:17.240 --> 04:18.630
you'll see

04:18.680 --> 04:19.310
I'm right.

04:20.740 --> 04:22.140
[Orchid Snow]

04:22.170 --> 04:23.630
These are all fine things.

05:17.310 --> 05:17.830
Please.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.000
The Li family from the capital

05:22.000 --> 05:23.040
respectfully presents

05:23.040 --> 05:25.470
aged Golden Thread tea!

05:27.170 --> 05:29.970
[Golden Thread]

05:39.420 --> 05:41.820
[Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

05:45.060 --> 05:46.240
We can't expect anything close

05:46.240 --> 05:47.510
to the treatment Sixth Master receives.

05:47.510 --> 05:49.680
He's enjoying the Grand Tea Competition.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.600
We're

05:50.800 --> 05:52.460
only drinking one kind of tea.

05:56.480 --> 05:58.390
You're drinking the champion tea.

05:58.390 --> 06:00.720
How could the Sixth Prince compare to you?

06:07.830 --> 06:09.230
This is Golden Thread tea

06:09.240 --> 06:11.570
presented by the Li family of the capital.

06:13.190 --> 06:14.210
I'm not fooled.

06:14.950 --> 06:16.280
This is from the palace.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.560
It's the very tea Li Wantang presents

06:18.560 --> 06:20.080
to His Majesty.

06:37.159 --> 06:38.510
How extraordinary.

06:40.159 --> 06:40.720
Madam,

06:41.310 --> 06:42.310
what do you think?

06:43.390 --> 06:45.240
Every year, Anhui offers tribute tea,

06:45.240 --> 06:47.440
but why isn't there tea of this quality?

06:47.630 --> 06:48.390
Go ask

06:48.630 --> 06:50.430
who gets such fine tea.

06:51.600 --> 06:53.060
It's no use asking others.

06:54.430 --> 06:55.600
Only my plantation

06:56.310 --> 06:57.310
can produce tea

06:57.560 --> 06:58.620
with such a flavor.

06:59.240 --> 07:00.120
Why is that?

07:01.200 --> 07:02.660
During these years of war,

07:02.950 --> 07:03.830
my tea plantation

07:03.830 --> 07:05.360
was completely burned down.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.820
What we had planted before

07:06.970 --> 07:08.570
were decades-old tea trees—

07:09.350 --> 07:10.350
our livelihood.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.610
But ironically, that fire

07:13.190 --> 07:14.240
changed the soil veins

07:14.240 --> 07:16.120
and altered the soil's properties.

07:16.120 --> 07:17.650
The new tea grown afterward

07:17.720 --> 07:18.360
now has this

07:18.360 --> 07:19.830
subtle orchid fragrance.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.510
On top of that, the seasoned tea master

07:22.510 --> 07:23.630
we hired

07:23.750 --> 07:24.310
uses

07:24.430 --> 07:26.420
a century-old large iron wok.

07:27.390 --> 07:28.920
This master usually can't bear to

07:28.920 --> 07:30.600
practice with real tea leaves,

07:30.600 --> 07:32.070
so he uses pine needles instead.

07:32.070 --> 07:33.030
Over time,

07:33.159 --> 07:34.360
the aroma of pine needles

07:34.360 --> 07:36.020
seeped into that old iron wok.

07:36.390 --> 07:38.250
Thus, the Orchid Snow tea of today

07:38.310 --> 07:40.440
acquired its unique aroma and flavor.

07:41.350 --> 07:42.230
However...

07:44.510 --> 07:45.240
what a shame.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.070
What's a shame?

07:51.159 --> 07:51.820
It's a shame

07:52.480 --> 07:54.280
that this Grand Tea Competition

07:54.560 --> 07:56.090
is all about raking in cash.

07:57.040 --> 07:57.680
You need to pay

07:57.680 --> 08:00.070
a 3,000-tael entrance fee
to enter the main gate

08:00.070 --> 08:02.070
and 5,000 taels for the second gate.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.000
Eight thousand taels of silver

08:03.000 --> 08:04.120
just to get in once.

08:04.750 --> 08:06.480
So if one wants to win first place,

08:06.480 --> 08:08.280
how much silver would that cost?

08:08.920 --> 08:09.780
And where would

08:10.040 --> 08:11.440
all this money come from?

08:11.710 --> 08:13.240
After all these years of war,

08:13.240 --> 08:15.310
the tea farmers are barely surviving.

08:15.310 --> 08:16.710
Must we still strip them

08:17.070 --> 08:18.070
to the bone?

08:19.480 --> 08:21.240
If the imperial court
truly had a conscience,

08:21.240 --> 08:23.360
it would use this Grand Tea Competition

08:23.360 --> 08:24.270
to give all tea farmers

08:24.270 --> 08:26.070
a way out of their hardship—

08:26.360 --> 08:27.830
that would be a benevolent policy

08:27.830 --> 08:29.360
for the people of Jiangnan.

08:29.920 --> 08:30.600
That's why

08:31.190 --> 08:32.470
I said it's a shame.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.770
Remember what he just said.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.360
Go back and write it down for me,

08:45.360 --> 08:47.020
so the Sixth Prince will know.

08:47.360 --> 08:48.030
Yes.

08:51.120 --> 08:51.750
Madam.

08:52.390 --> 08:54.460
What I just said was simply

08:54.960 --> 08:56.420
venting my frustrations.

08:56.550 --> 08:57.830
I'm just a common man.

08:57.870 --> 08:58.630
My words

08:59.200 --> 09:00.930
shouldn't be taken seriously.

09:01.120 --> 09:03.200
You look like a scholar.

09:03.550 --> 09:04.080
What?

09:04.240 --> 09:05.500
You stopped studying?

09:05.720 --> 09:06.440
To be honest...

09:06.440 --> 09:07.440
Who are you?

09:07.900 --> 09:08.910
Her Ladyship arranged for us

09:08.910 --> 09:10.000
to serve tea.

09:11.200 --> 09:12.240
What did you do?

09:13.240 --> 09:14.510
I offended the imperial court

09:14.510 --> 09:17.310
by causing a disturbance
in the examination hall.

09:18.240 --> 09:20.900
The Princess Consort sent someone
to serve tea.

09:21.420 --> 09:23.240
The Sixth Prince's wife sent it?

09:24.360 --> 09:25.270
Could it be that the Sixth Prince

09:25.270 --> 09:26.360
knows I'm here?

09:27.200 --> 09:27.960
That can't be.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.370
We didn't tell him.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.600
How would he know?

09:34.650 --> 09:35.550
I suppose Her Ladyship

09:35.550 --> 09:37.120
heard that His Highness has a female guest

09:37.120 --> 09:38.840
and sent someone to attend to us.

09:38.840 --> 09:39.670
Please rest assured,

09:39.670 --> 09:40.550
the ones who opened the door for us

09:40.550 --> 09:41.620
and escorted us in

09:41.750 --> 09:42.600
are all my trusted guards,

09:42.600 --> 09:44.120
whom I know well.

09:45.850 --> 09:47.510
The Sixth Prince is so imposing.

09:47.510 --> 09:48.320
We shouldn't

09:48.360 --> 09:49.580
spoil his mood.

09:50.270 --> 09:52.160
However, refusing his tea

09:52.200 --> 09:54.260
wouldn't be proper guest etiquette.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.210
You can't drink it!

10:15.480 --> 10:16.140
This tea...

10:16.340 --> 10:17.870
What's wrong with this tea?

10:18.080 --> 10:18.940
How rude!

10:19.120 --> 10:21.180
Are we only allowed to drink your tea?

10:21.960 --> 10:22.390
No.

10:23.110 --> 10:24.240
The aroma of this tea

10:24.320 --> 10:25.380
clashes with mine.

10:32.550 --> 10:33.780
Let's go back.

10:41.460 --> 10:42.570
This jar of tea

10:42.630 --> 10:43.550
is for me?

10:48.450 --> 10:49.380
Exactly.

11:11.050 --> 11:12.450
What's wrong, Pingyuan?

11:22.440 --> 11:23.000
No,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.000
I just feel like

11:25.550 --> 11:27.270
the woman who brought the tea earlier

11:27.270 --> 11:27.870
is someone

11:27.870 --> 11:28.840
I've met before.

11:31.270 --> 11:32.000
Who?

11:33.120 --> 11:34.250
I'm not sure either.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.750
Anyway, every time she's near me,

11:36.750 --> 11:37.720
I feel uneasy.

11:38.270 --> 11:39.260
She's the kind of person who harms people

11:39.260 --> 11:40.320
wherever she goes.

11:40.590 --> 11:41.600
That's why I stopped her

11:41.600 --> 11:43.060
from drinking it just now.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.390
Always acting crazy.

11:47.670 --> 11:48.870
Should we go home now?

11:50.440 --> 11:51.500
Pack up our things.

11:55.030 --> 11:56.790
[Phoenix Singing in the Bamboo Grove]

12:01.440 --> 12:02.000
Eunuch?

12:02.960 --> 12:03.440
Eunuch.

12:04.320 --> 12:04.780
Eunuch.

12:08.320 --> 12:08.920
What is it?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.810
Just now in the garden, I saw...

12:11.910 --> 12:12.360
What?

12:12.600 --> 12:13.730
Did you see clearly?

12:13.750 --> 12:15.020
Yes, clear as day.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.170
Look at this tea.

12:19.150 --> 12:20.010
Your Highness.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.300
Your Highness.

12:22.030 --> 12:23.630
The Empress Dowager is here.

12:24.670 --> 12:26.130
Your Highness, please...

12:26.440 --> 12:26.900
Well...

12:30.320 --> 12:31.050
Are you sure?

12:31.080 --> 12:32.720
Si said he saw clearly.

12:32.790 --> 12:35.650
It was the Empress Dowager
from the western palace.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.730
Someone, come here.

12:55.360 --> 12:55.880
Your Highness,

12:55.880 --> 12:57.080
this servant is here.

12:57.840 --> 12:58.570
Where is she?

12:59.440 --> 13:00.120
Your Highness,

13:00.120 --> 13:01.140
I just asked.

13:01.240 --> 13:02.900
They said she's already left.

13:03.440 --> 13:04.770
What was she doing here?

13:04.790 --> 13:05.730
Someone said

13:05.790 --> 13:07.390
they saw her meeting two young men.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.440
The young men made a pot of tea.

13:08.440 --> 13:10.040
After drinking it, she left.

13:10.870 --> 13:11.880
Young men?

13:16.360 --> 13:17.240
Well, don't look at me.

13:17.240 --> 13:18.460
This is your mansion.

13:23.360 --> 13:24.160
Investigate.

13:24.750 --> 13:25.610
Find out who they were.

13:25.610 --> 13:26.550
Yes, Your Highness.

13:26.550 --> 13:28.410
Hurry and prepare my court robes.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.390
I need to enter the palace.

13:29.390 --> 13:29.870
Your Highness,

13:29.870 --> 13:31.080
what about the Grand Tea Competition?

13:31.080 --> 13:31.630
Wait, Brother.

13:31.630 --> 13:32.270
I'll go with you!

13:32.270 --> 13:33.200
I'll go with you!

13:34.840 --> 13:35.830
Nobody move!

13:36.270 --> 13:37.270
No one leaves!

13:37.630 --> 13:38.940
Anyone who steps outside will be killed!

13:38.770 --> 13:40.560
[Yunnan Tea Merchants' Association]

13:39.120 --> 13:40.650
-Kill who?
-Wait for His Highness to return!

13:40.650 --> 13:41.730
[Zhejiang Tea Merchants' Association]

13:41.150 --> 13:42.810
All of you, stay where you are!

13:43.150 --> 13:44.200
We'll be executed?

13:44.200 --> 13:45.630
Anyone who steps outside will be killed!

13:45.630 --> 13:47.490
Wait until His Highness returns!

13:47.870 --> 13:48.930
Stay where you are!

13:49.150 --> 13:50.320
No one leaves!

13:50.720 --> 13:52.480
Step outside this courtyard and you die!

13:52.480 --> 13:53.790
Wait for His Highness to return!

13:53.790 --> 13:54.850
Stay where you are!

13:55.240 --> 13:56.260
No one leaves!

13:56.790 --> 13:58.390
Step outside this courtyard and you die!

13:58.390 --> 14:00.190
Wait for His Highness to return!

14:00.270 --> 14:01.390
Stay where you are!

14:01.670 --> 14:02.810
No one leaves!

14:03.150 --> 14:04.910
Step outside this courtyard and you die!

14:04.910 --> 14:05.960
Wait for His Highness to return!

14:05.960 --> 14:06.440
Eunuch!

14:06.440 --> 14:07.270
Eunuch, wait!

14:13.540 --> 14:17.630
[Celestial Garden in Full Bloom]

14:13.670 --> 14:14.790
Tell those tea merchants

14:14.790 --> 14:15.840
to leave the tea samples

14:15.840 --> 14:16.480
they brought.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.960
They should stay in the capital
and not wander around.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.150
After I consult with the Empress Dowager,

14:18.230 --> 14:20.900
[Celestial Garden in Full Bloom]

14:19.200 --> 14:19.870
we will announce

14:19.870 --> 14:21.360
who wins the title
of Top Tea Under Heaven.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.150
As for the others,

14:22.150 --> 14:22.960
tell them to stop making a fuss!

14:22.960 --> 14:24.090
Yes, Your Highness.

14:24.690 --> 14:29.420
[Changchun Palace]

14:26.550 --> 14:27.520
I heard

14:27.780 --> 14:30.240
that Your Majesty just visited
my residence,

14:30.240 --> 14:31.970
but I wasn't there to greet you.

14:32.270 --> 14:34.130
This is an unforgivable offense.

14:34.600 --> 14:36.540
I simply enjoy lively gatherings

14:36.770 --> 14:38.700
and wanted to take a look from afar.

14:39.200 --> 14:40.670
I've tasted the tea

14:40.720 --> 14:42.190
and seen the event.

14:42.480 --> 14:44.630
I deliberately didn't have anyone
inform you,

14:44.630 --> 14:46.520
fearing it might disrupt
your serious affairs.

14:46.520 --> 14:48.180
What offense is there in that?

14:49.180 --> 14:51.240
In any case,
I haven't been attentive enough

14:51.240 --> 14:52.640
in serving Your Majesty.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.750
This Grand Tea Competition

14:53.750 --> 14:55.200
was planned by me and Li Wantang,
a prominent merchant

14:55.200 --> 14:56.360
from the capital.

14:57.030 --> 14:58.510
Due to the unrest in Jiangnan
over the years,

14:58.510 --> 15:00.000
the north and south have been cut off,

15:00.000 --> 15:02.150
making tea as precious as gold
in the capital.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.000
Finally, the military situation

15:03.000 --> 15:03.790
has improved somewhat,

15:03.790 --> 15:05.360
and the Grand Canal has been repaired.

15:05.360 --> 15:06.490
I thought

15:06.630 --> 15:07.750
we could bring
all the southern tea merchants

15:07.750 --> 15:08.480
together

15:08.510 --> 15:10.640
for a little gathering in the capital.

15:10.840 --> 15:12.360
If business can resume normally,

15:12.360 --> 15:13.360
at least it'll allow merchants

15:13.360 --> 15:14.760
to get back on their feet.

15:14.910 --> 15:17.180
Thus, our court will collect more taxes,

15:17.440 --> 15:18.900
and the tea farmers' lives

15:19.200 --> 15:20.440
will improve as well.

15:20.810 --> 15:24.090
[Empress Dowager Cixi]

15:26.960 --> 15:30.000
Sixth Prince, you truly think of
the nation's welfare.

15:30.000 --> 15:31.320
The Grand Tea Competition

15:31.320 --> 15:32.870
has created quite a spectacle,

15:32.870 --> 15:35.530
and it benefits
both the country and its people.

15:35.600 --> 15:37.550
You are indeed a virtuous prince.

15:38.480 --> 15:40.610
You flatter me greatly, Your Majesty.

15:42.000 --> 15:43.050
What a pity.

15:43.960 --> 15:46.080
The entrance fees at your residence
are too expensive.

15:46.080 --> 15:47.550
Three thousand taels for the main gate

15:47.550 --> 15:49.480
and 5,000 taels for the second gate.

15:49.480 --> 15:51.550
I didn't bring
that many banknotes with me,

15:51.550 --> 15:52.680
so I had to come back.

15:52.880 --> 15:55.840
I wonder who won the title

15:55.910 --> 15:57.440
of the Top Tea Under Heaven.

15:57.670 --> 15:59.320
Your Majesty, please forgive me!

15:59.320 --> 16:01.670
This servant knows nothing
about these matters.

16:01.670 --> 16:02.600
When I return...

16:03.120 --> 16:03.960
When I return,

16:03.960 --> 16:05.120
I'll kill

16:05.600 --> 16:06.930
all those gatekeepers.

16:07.570 --> 16:09.550
There's a Bodhisattva statue in this room.

16:09.550 --> 16:11.640
Don't talk about killing or violence.

16:11.640 --> 16:13.400
Mind your words.

16:13.600 --> 16:14.660
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:15.510 --> 16:17.510
Serve them both

16:17.550 --> 16:18.790
the good tea

16:18.840 --> 16:19.670
we had

16:19.710 --> 16:21.200
at the Sixth Prince's Mansion.

16:21.200 --> 16:23.920
This tea tastes quite good to me.

16:24.060 --> 16:25.840
But sadly, like me,

16:25.910 --> 16:27.750
they couldn't afford the entrance fees

16:27.750 --> 16:29.600
and missed out.

16:29.750 --> 16:30.810
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:45.720 --> 16:46.320
Well...

16:47.250 --> 16:49.110
Thank you for Your Majesty's tea.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.150
Well...

17:02.690 --> 17:03.970
[Orchid Snow]

17:03.910 --> 17:05.790
Seriously, I'm baffled.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.880
Well, where did she

17:07.880 --> 17:09.200
get this tea from?

17:11.819 --> 17:15.579
[Orchid Snow]

17:13.030 --> 17:13.510
Look.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.420
Don't you understand yet?

17:21.640 --> 17:23.780
The words "Top" and "Under Heaven"

17:24.680 --> 17:26.609
have already deeply offended her.

17:29.520 --> 17:30.320
Let me ask you—

17:31.920 --> 17:32.960
whose domain is

17:34.160 --> 17:35.400
all under heaven?

17:37.440 --> 17:38.550
Certainly not yours.

17:38.550 --> 17:39.430
No, no, no.

17:39.460 --> 17:40.920
And it's not mine, either.

17:49.530 --> 17:52.270
[Sanjin Merchants' Hall]

17:52.720 --> 17:53.350
Pingyuan,

17:53.960 --> 17:56.290
we've only been in the capital
for one day.

17:56.640 --> 17:58.240
I haven't had enough fun yet.

18:00.070 --> 18:02.720
I heard that the area
outside Qianmen Street is really lively.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.120
Outside Qianmen Street?

18:04.750 --> 18:06.830
Outside Qianmen Street is
the red-light district.

18:06.830 --> 18:07.830
Who told you that?

18:09.720 --> 18:11.440
From the way you said that,
you've clearly been there before.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.920
You knew exactly what I was talking about.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.680
I was just a poor scholar back then.

18:14.680 --> 18:15.240
How could I afford

18:15.240 --> 18:16.640
such dens of indulgence?

18:18.640 --> 18:19.680
Let's hurry back.

18:19.750 --> 18:20.790
The tea can't be stored for very long.

18:20.790 --> 18:21.990
Get up and get to work.

18:25.320 --> 18:26.480
We've already bragged about

18:26.480 --> 18:28.110
winning the Grand Tea Competition.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.070
I don't know what happened

18:29.070 --> 18:30.670
to that friend who helped me.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.130
I need to ask around.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.310
Mr. Gu!

18:34.960 --> 18:35.440
Mr. Gu,

18:35.510 --> 18:36.570
you have a visitor.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.850
Are you Mr. Gu from Huizhou?

18:40.240 --> 18:41.190
I'm Gu Pingyuan.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.460
May I ask your name?

18:42.790 --> 18:43.880
Bao Qing.

18:43.010 --> 18:46.030
[Bao Qing, Military Affairs Officer]

18:44.270 --> 18:45.870
I've heard so much about you.

18:46.110 --> 18:46.880
It's an honor

18:47.200 --> 18:48.660
to finally meet you today.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.770
So you're Mr. Bao Qing.

18:52.350 --> 18:53.080
I wonder how I

18:53.090 --> 18:54.420
can be of service to you.

18:54.640 --> 18:55.440
I have a friend

18:55.680 --> 18:57.110
who's on duty at the imperial court today

18:57.110 --> 18:58.000
and cannot leave his post.

18:58.000 --> 18:59.510
So he asked me to come in his place

18:59.510 --> 19:01.720
to invite you to his residence
for a banquet.

19:01.720 --> 19:03.680
Please do us this honor.

19:07.050 --> 19:08.160
[Anhui Governor Qiao Song respectfully
extends an invitation to Mr. Gu Pingyuan]

19:08.180 --> 19:09.470
[to a banquet at my residence,
feeling both anxious and deeply honored.]

19:16.130 --> 19:17.010
Mr. Bao Qing,

19:17.790 --> 19:19.160
Governor Qiao—Qiao Song—

19:19.160 --> 19:20.720
is our provincial governor,

19:20.720 --> 19:22.120
our respected official.

19:22.440 --> 19:23.900
I've never met him before.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.720
I wonder why he's looking for me.

19:26.310 --> 19:27.690
You must go, Mr. Gu.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.070
Please do us this favor.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.830
I'm here at my friend's request.

19:30.830 --> 19:32.090
I had to make this trip.

19:32.590 --> 19:34.320
I pay my respects to you, Mr. Gu.

19:44.200 --> 19:44.830
Mr. Qiao!

19:46.790 --> 19:47.850
Mr. Gu has arrived.

19:50.030 --> 19:51.430
Gu, let me introduce you.

19:51.600 --> 19:52.730
This is Qiao Song.

19:53.240 --> 19:53.920
Greetings, Governor Qiao.

19:53.920 --> 19:54.510
What are you doing?

19:54.510 --> 19:55.270
Don't be like this.

19:55.270 --> 19:56.470
Please get up. Get up.

19:56.880 --> 19:58.000
Don't be like this.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.560
I can't accept such formality.

20:00.590 --> 20:01.310
Governor Qiao, you're the protector

20:01.310 --> 20:02.370
of us Anhui people.

20:02.790 --> 20:03.830
Kneeling before you

20:03.830 --> 20:04.690
is only proper.

20:04.790 --> 20:05.080
[Qiao Song, Governor of Anhui]

20:05.110 --> 20:06.240
That's not how it should be.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.380
From now on, Gu,

20:07.590 --> 20:09.720
we shall treat each other as brothers.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.870
Please enlighten me, Governor.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.200
Why have you summoned

20:15.200 --> 20:16.200
my brother and me?

20:16.790 --> 20:17.480
Otherwise,

20:17.960 --> 20:18.820
I dare not drink

20:18.830 --> 20:19.720
or speak freely.

20:19.720 --> 20:20.980
Being kept in the dark,

20:21.160 --> 20:22.360
I'd die with regrets.

20:24.550 --> 20:25.200
Gu,

20:25.880 --> 20:27.590
you were just serving tea
to Her Majesty the Empress Dowager

20:27.590 --> 20:29.680
at the Sixth Prince's Mansion.

20:33.390 --> 20:35.680
Her Majesty was very pleased.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.980
She told her personal eunuch

20:38.090 --> 20:40.150
that it's remarkable indeed

20:40.400 --> 20:42.070
that Anhui has produced
such a tea merchant

20:42.070 --> 20:43.490
with such insight.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.160
Remarkable.

20:44.160 --> 20:46.160
When these words reached me,

20:46.590 --> 20:48.190
how could I not feel ashamed?

20:48.400 --> 20:51.000
Having received such praise
from Her Majesty—

20:51.030 --> 20:53.590
if I didn't come personally
to express my gratitude,

20:53.590 --> 20:55.620
how could I possibly sleep?

20:55.740 --> 20:57.160
We couldn't sleep at all.

21:04.200 --> 21:04.920
Mr. Gu,

21:04.920 --> 21:06.680
come on, let me toast you.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.440
Cheers.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.850
Governor Qiao, you seem troubled.

21:18.240 --> 21:19.510
As for the battle at Hefei,

21:19.510 --> 21:21.030
I'm not worried about that.

21:21.030 --> 21:22.360
I'm from the Northwest.

21:23.020 --> 21:24.790
The imperial court ordered me
to train troops

21:24.790 --> 21:27.240
to quell the rebellion in the Northwest.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.680
The situation there,

21:28.680 --> 21:30.310
though complicated to explain,

21:30.310 --> 21:31.960
can be summed up in one sentence:

21:31.960 --> 21:33.270
the traitors within conspire,

21:33.270 --> 21:35.070
and enemies from outside invade.

21:35.070 --> 21:36.700
But even if I train the army

21:36.750 --> 21:38.070
into elite troops,

21:38.310 --> 21:40.040
once we reach the Northwest...

21:40.270 --> 21:41.600
it'll still be useless.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.640
How could it be useless?

21:44.270 --> 21:45.400
This is no longer

21:45.440 --> 21:47.070
the age of swords and spears.

21:47.640 --> 21:48.500
Think about it—

21:48.680 --> 21:50.140
the foreigners' firearms are formidable.

21:50.140 --> 21:52.680
Their guns and cannons
dominate the battlefield.

21:52.680 --> 21:53.640
Their rifles are

21:53.680 --> 21:54.830
now breech-loading.

21:54.830 --> 21:56.060
They can load five bullets at once,

21:56.060 --> 21:57.680
each with a range of 500 meters,

21:57.680 --> 21:59.750
firing once every eight to nine seconds.

21:59.750 --> 22:00.310
And ours?

22:00.590 --> 22:01.560
Our muskets

22:01.680 --> 22:03.140
are still muzzle-loaded.

22:03.310 --> 22:05.720
It takes two minutes
just to load one shot,

22:05.880 --> 22:07.610
with a range of only 100 meters.

22:07.880 --> 22:09.640
We'd be killed before we

22:10.640 --> 22:11.700
even saw the enemy.

22:13.030 --> 22:14.480
Those rebels in the Northwest

22:14.480 --> 22:16.280
are all using foreign firearms.

22:16.920 --> 22:17.750
I heard from my friends

22:17.750 --> 22:18.880
who fought there

22:19.480 --> 22:21.480
that while defending a mountain pass,

22:21.480 --> 22:23.790
our entire battalion of musketeers

22:23.830 --> 22:25.960
could only watch helplessly as men fell,

22:25.960 --> 22:27.590
unable to advance!

22:29.160 --> 22:31.000
Since the rebels can buy from foreigners,

22:31.000 --> 22:31.680
why can't the imperial court

22:31.680 --> 22:32.680
do the same?

22:34.510 --> 22:36.040
We can buy them, certainly.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.590
But how many foreign rifles

22:37.590 --> 22:38.990
are actually available?

22:39.350 --> 22:40.830
The Xiang Army wants them,
the Huai Army wants them,

22:40.830 --> 22:42.640
and the imperial court wants them too.

22:42.640 --> 22:44.240
One rifle costs 16 taels of silver,

22:44.240 --> 22:46.110
and it takes seven to eight months
to arrive.

22:46.110 --> 22:47.310
I ordered 300 rifles.

22:47.480 --> 22:48.410
It's been a year,

22:49.030 --> 22:51.030
and I haven't seen a trace of them.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.680
I don't think this is difficult.

22:56.750 --> 22:57.910
My brother...

22:58.200 --> 22:59.110
he knows how to do business.

22:59.110 --> 23:00.440
He'll always find a way.

23:00.750 --> 23:01.880
Don't talk nonsense.

23:01.880 --> 23:03.310
Who knows how to do business?

23:03.310 --> 23:04.110
Don't forget,

23:04.590 --> 23:05.480
up until now,

23:05.510 --> 23:07.070
we haven't sold a single tael of tea.

23:07.070 --> 23:08.670
Stop talking nonsense here.

23:10.000 --> 23:11.790
Don't worry about the tea.

23:11.960 --> 23:13.270
With Her Majesty's endorsement,

23:13.270 --> 23:14.550
your tea practically

23:14.720 --> 23:15.920
sells itself.

23:17.920 --> 23:18.830
As for the rifles,

23:18.830 --> 23:21.270
I was just venting my frustrations.

23:22.110 --> 23:23.200
I've never heard of

23:23.240 --> 23:25.440
any merchant who can trade in firearms.

23:28.070 --> 23:28.530
Come on,

23:28.830 --> 23:29.960
Mr. Gu, let's drink.

23:30.350 --> 23:31.280
Cheers, cheers.

23:39.480 --> 23:40.340
Governor Qiao.

23:41.510 --> 23:42.920
If it's convenient for you,

23:42.920 --> 23:44.780
please provide me with the models

23:44.960 --> 23:47.270
and written specifications
of the firearms you need.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.070
When I have time,

23:48.070 --> 23:49.070
I'll look into it.

23:49.600 --> 23:50.280
If this path

23:50.310 --> 23:51.440
can truly be opened,

23:52.440 --> 23:53.770
it would be a good thing.

23:55.880 --> 23:56.960
Sure.

23:58.030 --> 23:58.680
Mr. Gu!

23:59.270 --> 24:00.200
Just hearing you say that

24:00.200 --> 24:01.550
gives us a little hope!

24:01.830 --> 24:02.350
Hope.

24:03.110 --> 24:03.920
Let's not talk about it anymore.

24:03.920 --> 24:04.850
Come on, cheers.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.640
Let's have another round.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.270
I can see

24:06.720 --> 24:07.920
that you're genuinely

24:07.920 --> 24:09.720
working for the people of Anhui.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.830
As someone from Anhui, it's my duty

24:11.830 --> 24:13.030
to share your burden.

24:16.830 --> 24:17.590
Come on, come on.

24:17.590 --> 24:18.110
Cheers.

24:26.750 --> 24:27.550
What's wrong?

24:28.960 --> 24:30.550
You're asking me what's wrong?

24:30.550 --> 24:31.270
Why did you lock me up

24:31.270 --> 24:32.350
like a dog?

24:32.880 --> 24:33.940
You e-even had them

24:33.960 --> 24:35.880
seal the windows with wooden slats!

24:35.880 --> 24:37.210
You really want to know?

24:37.400 --> 24:38.070
Yes.

24:39.720 --> 24:40.270
Fine.

24:40.830 --> 24:42.680
I'll tell the truth,
and you must tell the truth too.

24:42.680 --> 24:44.610
Neither of us can lie to each other.

24:46.640 --> 24:48.040
I won't tell a single lie.

24:49.480 --> 24:51.080
Alright. I'll ask you first.

24:52.550 --> 24:55.410
What were you trying to do
by going out this morning?

25:01.510 --> 25:02.710
If you want the truth,

25:03.200 --> 25:05.200
you must answer truthfully as well.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.590
Gu Pingyuan came.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.680
He brought his tea,

25:11.680 --> 25:13.750
wanting to participate in
the Grand Tea Competition.

25:13.750 --> 25:14.720
I promised to help him

25:14.720 --> 25:16.380
by using my token to get him in.

25:16.680 --> 25:18.810
But I've failed to fulfill my promise!

25:22.160 --> 25:23.560
You wanted to help him...

25:27.110 --> 25:28.510
Alright, you can ask now.

25:28.590 --> 25:30.120
Why didn't you let me go out?

25:34.880 --> 25:35.880
Ms. Su...

25:37.030 --> 25:39.000
She heard that the Empress Dowager
from the western palace

25:39.000 --> 25:40.160
would be
at the Sixth Prince's Mansion today

25:40.160 --> 25:41.890
for the Grand Tea Competition.

25:42.750 --> 25:43.550
Tomorrow, I'll slip in

25:43.550 --> 25:45.350
by blending in
with your merchants' association.

25:45.350 --> 25:47.200
You don't need to worry about
what happens afterward.

25:47.200 --> 25:49.200
I promise you won't be implicated.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.490
You can't promise that.

25:51.790 --> 25:54.590
This is the sort of offense
that dooms an entire family line.

25:54.590 --> 25:56.190
You need to be honest with me.

25:58.030 --> 25:59.750
What is the relationship

26:00.350 --> 26:02.270
between the Empress Dowager
and the Sixth Prince now?

26:02.270 --> 26:04.800
Naturally, she regards him as
a trusted aide.

26:05.640 --> 26:08.300
Sister-in-law and brother-in-law
are family.

26:09.000 --> 26:12.330
Isn't it said that the ruler and ministers
govern together?

26:12.510 --> 26:14.040
You actually believe that?

26:15.030 --> 26:17.270
There's no such thing as shared rule.

26:18.070 --> 26:19.920
Once she became Empress Dowager,

26:19.920 --> 26:21.880
she took the Sixth Prince's
favorite daughter

26:21.880 --> 26:24.270
as her goddaughter
and kept her by her side.

26:24.270 --> 26:26.470
To outsiders, it appears to be an honor.

26:26.510 --> 26:27.350
In reality,

26:27.750 --> 26:28.310
his daughter is just

26:28.310 --> 26:29.840
a hostage used as leverage.

26:30.750 --> 26:31.790
Besides, the Sixth Prince

26:31.790 --> 26:33.350
oversees the Office of General Management.

26:33.350 --> 26:35.400
The Empress Dowager doesn't dare
move against him—

26:35.400 --> 26:36.930
not because she values him,

26:37.240 --> 26:39.790
but because he uses foreigners
as his backing.

26:39.790 --> 26:42.850
The Empress Dowager is wary of
causing complications.

26:45.350 --> 26:47.950
I heard that the Empress Dowager
is displeased

26:48.590 --> 26:50.850
with tomorrow's Grand Tea Competition.

26:50.920 --> 26:52.590
She plans to enter through the rear gate

26:52.590 --> 26:56.590
of the Sixth Prince's Mansion
accompanied only by her personal eunuch.

26:56.880 --> 26:57.720
Ms. Su,

26:58.480 --> 26:59.680
how could outsiders possibly know

26:59.680 --> 27:01.740
the Empress Dowager's whereabouts?

27:03.030 --> 27:04.440
I bought this information

27:04.440 --> 27:06.370
from her personal eunuch himself.

27:07.320 --> 27:08.280
My plan is...

27:08.310 --> 27:09.440
Ms. Su, stop, stop.

27:09.590 --> 27:10.490
I don't want to hear it. I don't.

27:10.490 --> 27:11.310
I'm begging you.

27:11.310 --> 27:11.790
Alright.

27:11.790 --> 27:13.120
Say no more, say no more.

27:16.200 --> 27:17.880
Ms. Su intended to

27:17.920 --> 27:19.440
poison her secretly.

27:19.880 --> 27:20.640
She told me

27:20.750 --> 27:22.550
that everyone
attending the Grand Tea Competition today

27:22.550 --> 27:23.280
would likely

27:24.070 --> 27:25.920
not make it out alive.

27:27.440 --> 27:28.570
That's everything.

27:30.030 --> 27:30.640
Father,

27:31.160 --> 27:32.400
have you lost your mind?

27:32.400 --> 27:34.640
You're actually involved in a plot
to kill the Empress Dowager?

27:34.640 --> 27:36.550
Do you know who Ms. Su is?

27:37.790 --> 27:38.480
No.

27:39.110 --> 27:40.240
You've grown up now.

27:41.200 --> 27:42.480
It's time I told you

27:42.510 --> 27:43.710
our family's secret.

27:44.790 --> 27:46.750
Have you heard of Lord Gong Deng?

27:48.510 --> 27:49.110
Yes.

27:49.750 --> 27:50.920
The Chief Grand Councillor,

27:50.920 --> 27:52.440
a pillar of the state, was executed

27:52.440 --> 27:55.100
on the Empress Dowager's orders
for his crimes.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.280
That's right.

28:07.200 --> 28:08.070
Lord Gong

28:08.940 --> 28:10.960
was the Empress Dowager's sworn enemy,

28:10.960 --> 28:12.290
which cost him his life.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.200
Ms. Su...

28:14.830 --> 28:16.720
is Lord Gong's only daughter.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.160
She...

28:21.750 --> 28:23.410
Our Li family owes everything

28:24.430 --> 28:25.940
we have today to Lord Gong.

28:26.790 --> 28:27.990
Let me put it this way—

28:28.340 --> 28:29.930
we were his bookkeepers

28:30.350 --> 28:32.210
and also his household servants.

28:34.200 --> 28:35.920
Fortunately, that court struggle

28:35.920 --> 28:37.370
didn't affect us.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.460
Do you understand now?

28:42.790 --> 28:44.880
But there's one thing
I still don't understand.

28:44.880 --> 28:46.590
Lord Gong Deng is already dead,

28:46.590 --> 28:47.510
so why does Ms. Su

28:47.510 --> 28:49.110
still wield such influence?

28:51.070 --> 28:52.550
A giant

28:52.720 --> 28:54.120
doesn't fall overnight.

28:54.240 --> 28:55.180
Lord Gong

28:55.790 --> 28:56.960
served as Chief Grand Councillor

28:56.960 --> 28:58.270
for his entire career.

28:59.550 --> 29:02.150
His disciples and old friends
are everywhere.

29:05.030 --> 29:06.830
He commanded the southern campaigns,

29:06.830 --> 29:08.400
and the viceroys and governors
of Jiangnan,

29:08.400 --> 29:10.400
along with the frontier officials,

29:11.240 --> 29:12.960
were all his loyal followers.

29:14.350 --> 29:15.880
His influence was immense.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.440
Do you think

29:18.510 --> 29:20.320
we're the only bookkeepers?

29:21.590 --> 29:22.920
Do you think Ms. Su

29:23.000 --> 29:24.650
cares that much about us?

29:26.200 --> 29:28.000
She could turn us in

29:28.070 --> 29:29.800
to the imperial court anytime.

29:32.270 --> 29:33.340
When that happens,

29:35.140 --> 29:37.180
the label of "rebel remnants"

29:38.240 --> 29:39.720
would instantly lead to our family's

29:39.720 --> 29:41.050
complete destruction.

29:41.680 --> 29:42.680
"Li Million"?

29:44.340 --> 29:45.750
What Li Million?

29:46.720 --> 29:48.940
Even if we had ten million
or a hundred million taels,

29:48.940 --> 29:50.070
in their eyes,

29:50.110 --> 29:51.570
we would still be nothing.

29:57.400 --> 29:58.790
I didn't tell you before

29:58.830 --> 30:01.290
because I was afraid
you couldn't handle it.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.790
Now that you know,

30:04.020 --> 30:05.420
remember all this, okay?

30:11.310 --> 30:12.510
I don't know

30:12.750 --> 30:14.960
when I might die because of this matter.

30:16.680 --> 30:18.280
You could be implicated too.

30:18.550 --> 30:19.550
Or we might have to

30:19.870 --> 30:21.110
flee for our lives.

30:23.590 --> 30:25.990
Therefore, we must be extremely cautious.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.960
That kind of mistake—rashly making

30:28.960 --> 30:30.620
bold promises out of loyalty—

30:31.770 --> 30:33.410
must never happen.

30:38.440 --> 30:40.030
I didn't even get a chance
to make that mistake.

30:40.030 --> 30:42.030
I didn't even get to leave the house.

30:53.200 --> 30:55.660
What's the name of the tea
your friend grows?

30:59.400 --> 31:00.260
Orchid Snow...

31:00.790 --> 31:01.720
Orchid Snow tea.

31:07.830 --> 31:10.560
The Sixth Prince went to the palace
to apologize.

31:10.890 --> 31:14.200
The Empress Dowager rewarded him
with a jar of Orchid Snow tea

31:14.200 --> 31:15.680
and told him to savor it.

31:19.110 --> 31:21.710
Your friend has attracted
too much attention.

31:50.510 --> 31:51.310
Pingwen.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.070
Pingwen,

32:03.400 --> 32:04.060
is that you?

32:14.400 --> 32:15.310
Ms. Su.

32:20.310 --> 32:20.720
You...

32:20.960 --> 32:21.750
Gu,

32:23.170 --> 32:25.140
are you the bane of my existence?

32:26.640 --> 32:27.570
What have I done?

32:27.880 --> 32:29.490
Meddling in my affairs—

32:30.060 --> 32:31.750
are you tired of living,

32:31.790 --> 32:32.510
huh?

32:33.420 --> 32:34.680
Why did you try to kill her?

32:34.680 --> 32:35.680
What's it to you?

32:35.750 --> 32:36.920
That's Empress Dowager Cixi.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.680
She is my mortal enemy.

32:38.920 --> 32:39.810
Since my father died,

32:39.810 --> 32:41.270
I've been plotting,

32:41.440 --> 32:43.850
carefully calculating every move.

32:44.600 --> 32:46.530
Finally, the opportunity came...

32:48.090 --> 32:50.080
to avenge him.

32:51.110 --> 32:52.640
But you ruined everything.

32:53.070 --> 32:53.920
Ms. Su,

32:54.790 --> 32:55.790
please calm down.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.480
I truly didn't know

32:56.480 --> 32:57.160
what was happening

32:57.160 --> 32:58.120
earlier today.

32:58.590 --> 33:00.190
Put down the crossbow first.

33:00.920 --> 33:02.120
Let's talk properly.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.480
Pingyuan?

33:15.350 --> 33:16.010
Pingyuan!

33:16.400 --> 33:17.330
Are you alright?

33:17.480 --> 33:18.110
Pingyuan!

33:20.720 --> 33:21.320
Pingyuan?

33:21.920 --> 33:23.000
Pingyuan, are you alright?

33:23.000 --> 33:23.640
Pingyuan.

33:27.760 --> 33:29.220
Pingwen, you're dead too?

33:31.240 --> 33:31.830
What's wrong with you?

33:31.830 --> 33:32.790
Are you still half-asleep?

33:32.790 --> 33:33.270
Wait...

33:34.750 --> 33:35.510
Is this real?

33:35.530 --> 33:36.690
Am I dreaming?

33:36.830 --> 33:37.830
You're disoriented from waking up.

33:37.830 --> 33:38.530
Come on, get up now.

33:38.530 --> 33:39.050
No, no!

33:41.000 --> 33:41.880
Punch me.

33:48.290 --> 33:49.690
Couldn't you be gentler?

33:55.720 --> 33:57.650
Thank goodness it was just a dream.

34:20.670 --> 34:21.190
You...

34:22.070 --> 34:23.730
What are you muttering about?

34:23.880 --> 34:24.980
Kneel down!

34:25.400 --> 34:26.230
Imperial decree!

34:26.150 --> 34:28.010
[Sanjin Merchants' Hall]

34:47.960 --> 34:50.580
Imperial decree from the Empress Dowager!

34:50.350 --> 34:54.320
[Sanjin Merchants' Hall]

34:50.760 --> 34:53.110
The Orchid Snow tea,
presented by farmer Gu Pingyuan

34:53.110 --> 34:54.679
from Huizhou,

34:54.880 --> 34:57.010
boasts a noble and elegant fragrance.

34:57.070 --> 34:59.840
The man himself is well-versed
in literature and principles,

34:59.840 --> 35:02.030
and much of what he says
is worth considering.

35:02.030 --> 35:03.690
In recognition of both his tea

35:03.710 --> 35:05.030
and his heartfelt intentions,

35:05.030 --> 35:06.880
a plaque is hereby bestowed.

35:19.130 --> 35:21.700
Bring out the Empress Dowager's plaque!

35:23.730 --> 35:25.180
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

35:31.030 --> 35:39.780
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

35:40.480 --> 35:42.150
The Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association

35:42.150 --> 35:43.510
and Fujian Tea Merchants' Association

35:43.510 --> 35:45.310
have come to pay their respects!

35:48.320 --> 35:49.120
Old Master Hu!

35:49.760 --> 35:51.480
You've won the top prize this time.

35:51.480 --> 35:52.540
Congratulations.

35:52.590 --> 35:54.190
I don't deserve such praise.

35:54.510 --> 35:55.570
Why be so modest?

35:55.920 --> 35:58.070
It was personally approved
by Her Majesty the Empress Dowager.

35:58.070 --> 35:59.440
Every tea merchant under heaven

35:59.440 --> 36:00.700
must be envious of you.

36:01.800 --> 36:02.610
Old Master Hu,

36:03.190 --> 36:04.520
please take me to see

36:04.540 --> 36:06.400
the imperial plaque
written by Her Majesty herself.

36:06.400 --> 36:07.400
I'll kowtow to it.

36:07.400 --> 36:07.930
That way,

36:08.070 --> 36:10.000
I'll have something to brag about.

36:10.280 --> 36:10.880
My friend,

36:11.000 --> 36:12.110
come on, let's sit and talk.

36:12.110 --> 36:13.440
Have a seat, have a seat.

36:13.590 --> 36:14.190
Sit.

36:20.800 --> 36:21.400
My friend,

36:22.280 --> 36:23.480
to be honest with you,

36:23.880 --> 36:25.000
the plaque

36:25.320 --> 36:26.800
isn't with me.

36:31.400 --> 36:32.360
Old Master Hu,

36:33.030 --> 36:34.360
I'm not asking for much.

36:34.360 --> 36:35.960
Just grant me a tael of Orchid Snow tea.

36:35.960 --> 36:36.480
Really.

36:36.550 --> 36:38.770
I'll place this tea on my altar.

36:39.230 --> 36:41.130
If you still refuse,

36:41.360 --> 36:42.960
our friendship of many years

36:43.760 --> 36:44.670
will end today.

36:53.870 --> 36:55.270
My friend, rest assured.

36:56.110 --> 36:57.440
I'll definitely get you

36:57.440 --> 36:59.330
that one tael of tea.

36:59.510 --> 37:00.170
How's that?

37:00.630 --> 37:01.360
In that case,

37:01.800 --> 37:02.930
thank you very much.

37:03.550 --> 37:04.360
We're ready.

37:04.400 --> 37:05.230
We'll kneel and offer incense.

37:05.230 --> 37:06.190
Consider it done.

37:06.190 --> 37:06.630
I'll take my leave.

37:06.630 --> 37:08.550
Please excuse me for not seeing you out.

37:08.550 --> 37:09.290
Take care.

37:09.510 --> 37:10.570
See the guests out!

37:18.670 --> 37:19.190
Hou Er!

37:19.760 --> 37:20.230
Come in!

37:23.190 --> 37:23.710
Hu,

37:23.730 --> 37:25.690
this... this stupid mouth of mine.

37:26.080 --> 37:28.280
I've made a mess of things.

37:28.280 --> 37:29.880
Alright, alright, alright!

37:30.480 --> 37:31.470
Listen,

37:31.760 --> 37:33.320
I don't care if you have to kowtow

37:33.320 --> 37:34.320
or slap yourself—

37:34.480 --> 37:35.000
you must

37:35.510 --> 37:36.320
bring Gu Pingyuan

37:36.320 --> 37:37.440
here for me.

37:37.550 --> 37:39.110
In front of everyone,

37:39.190 --> 37:41.420
I'll kowtow to him, apologize,

37:41.590 --> 37:42.370
and make him

37:42.510 --> 37:44.630
the head
of our Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

37:44.630 --> 37:45.320
Go.

37:45.400 --> 37:46.330
Go now!

37:47.030 --> 37:47.400
I...

37:47.440 --> 37:48.710
Okay, okay, okay.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.070
Mr. Gu!

37:53.230 --> 37:54.460
Mr. Gu!

37:54.590 --> 37:56.110
Mr. Gu, my dear sir!

37:56.150 --> 37:57.700
Where are you, Mr. Gu?

37:58.150 --> 37:58.800
Mr. Gu!

37:58.960 --> 37:59.690
Hou Er?

38:00.050 --> 38:01.280
Oh, Mr. Gu!

38:01.360 --> 38:02.670
My dear Mr. Gu!

38:02.800 --> 38:04.070
Hou Er, what are you doing?

38:04.070 --> 38:04.730
Let go of me.

38:04.760 --> 38:05.230
Well,

38:05.440 --> 38:06.160
Mr. Gu,

38:06.230 --> 38:07.360
please listen to me.

38:07.710 --> 38:09.640
Earlier, I was blind and ignorant.

38:09.670 --> 38:10.360
Our Old Master Hu

38:10.360 --> 38:11.170
told me

38:11.190 --> 38:12.920
that even if it means
utterly disgracing myself,

38:12.920 --> 38:14.280
I must bring you to

38:14.280 --> 38:16.140
the Anhui Merchants' Hall today.

38:17.630 --> 38:18.030
Well,

38:18.290 --> 38:19.020
listen to me.

38:19.150 --> 38:20.350
Old Master Hu said...

38:21.360 --> 38:23.090
Old Master Hu is busy right now.

38:24.030 --> 38:24.670
He...

38:25.590 --> 38:26.450
can't get away.

38:26.510 --> 38:27.870
As long as you show up,

38:27.960 --> 38:30.890
he'll kowtow to you
and admit his mistakes in person.

38:35.190 --> 38:36.090
Today at noon,

38:37.030 --> 38:38.400
our Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

38:38.400 --> 38:39.670
has reserved Tongheju Restaurant

38:39.670 --> 38:41.760
to host all the tea merchants
from across the country

38:41.760 --> 38:43.400
to celebrate
our Anhui tea winning first place.

38:43.400 --> 38:44.950
If you don't show up,

38:45.800 --> 38:47.300
then all of us from Anhui

38:47.480 --> 38:49.070
will lose face, won't we?

38:49.090 --> 38:49.700
Well...

38:49.760 --> 38:51.890
My dear Mr. Gu,

38:52.110 --> 38:52.920
please come! I'm begging you!

38:52.920 --> 38:54.890
If you don't go, I'll cry myself to death!

38:53.700 --> 38:56.190
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

38:55.150 --> 38:56.350
Then go ahead and cry.

39:06.670 --> 39:09.150
Mr. Gu,

39:09.190 --> 39:11.600
how can you be so cruel?

39:17.280 --> 39:17.840
Hou Er.

39:18.360 --> 39:18.960
All right.

39:19.000 --> 39:19.730
Listen to me.

39:24.320 --> 39:25.260
Listen.

39:26.320 --> 39:28.580
We just had a misunderstanding earlier.

39:28.710 --> 39:29.510
Let bygones

39:29.710 --> 39:30.550
be bygones.

39:31.230 --> 39:32.430
As for Old Master Hu,

39:32.960 --> 39:33.550
I won't have him

39:33.550 --> 39:35.010
kneel and apologize to me.

39:35.230 --> 39:36.690
I'm going to visit him now.

39:37.760 --> 39:38.290
Pingwen.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.480
Pack some tea samples,

39:40.480 --> 39:41.320
take the plaque,

39:41.320 --> 39:42.190
rent a large cart,

39:42.190 --> 39:43.370
and wait for me at Tongheju Restaurant.

39:43.370 --> 39:46.830
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

39:48.450 --> 39:49.360
Come on, come on.

39:49.360 --> 39:49.840
Please.

39:50.140 --> 39:52.200
Here's the carriage I rented for you.

39:52.230 --> 39:52.760
Please.

40:00.840 --> 40:01.360
Mr. Gu,

40:02.030 --> 40:03.490
let me offer you my apology

40:03.510 --> 40:04.910
with tea instead of wine.

40:05.100 --> 40:06.760
No need for more polite words.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.920
We all belong to
the Anhui tea merchant community.

40:08.920 --> 40:09.550
Yes, yes, yes.

40:09.550 --> 40:10.110
As long as you

40:10.110 --> 40:11.030
stop bullying the tea farmers from now on,

40:11.030 --> 40:12.360
that will be worth
more than any polite words.

40:12.360 --> 40:13.560
I will, I will, I will.

40:13.800 --> 40:14.730
Come on, come on.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.030
Cheers.

40:24.960 --> 40:25.600
Mr. Gu,

40:25.670 --> 40:26.920
you're truly a broad-minded man.

40:26.920 --> 40:27.960
Actually, I have so much

40:27.960 --> 40:29.360
I've wanted to say to you.

40:29.750 --> 40:30.400
Mr. Gu?

40:30.670 --> 40:31.230
Mr. Gu?

40:32.110 --> 40:33.170
T-The tea...

40:34.440 --> 40:35.880
has been tampered with.

41:12.470 --> 41:16.540
[Xuming Inn]

41:18.480 --> 41:20.060
Everyone, I'm truly sorry.

41:20.150 --> 41:22.270
Mr. Gu really isn't here.

41:22.320 --> 41:23.720
Please come another day.

41:26.630 --> 41:29.030
Mr. Gu really isn't here.

41:29.030 --> 41:30.220
Please come another day.

41:30.220 --> 41:31.280
What are you doing?

41:31.280 --> 41:32.680
Please come another day.

41:48.670 --> 41:50.000
We're truly not receiving any visitors!

41:50.000 --> 41:51.400
Please come another day.

41:51.580 --> 41:52.710
What's going on here?

41:52.710 --> 41:53.510
Is this some kind of performance?

41:53.510 --> 41:54.440
Why such a crowd?

41:55.510 --> 41:58.980
This is the lodging
of the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

41:59.160 --> 42:00.670
I suppose all these people at the door

42:00.670 --> 42:02.000
are merchants from the capital,

42:02.000 --> 42:03.070
here to buy Orchid Snow tea.

42:03.070 --> 42:04.950
We're truly not receiving any visitors!

42:04.950 --> 42:06.410
Give them my calling card.

42:06.670 --> 42:07.800
Yes, Your Highness.

42:10.400 --> 42:11.920
Prince Gong has arrived!

42:18.180 --> 42:21.580
We humble subjects
kowtow to Your Highness!

42:23.070 --> 42:23.930
Rise and speak.

42:24.630 --> 42:26.090
Thank you, Your Highness.

42:27.070 --> 42:28.190
Where is Gu Pingyuan?

42:28.190 --> 42:30.250
M-My brother has gone missing again.

42:30.280 --> 42:31.000
Missing?

42:33.510 --> 42:35.710
This is Gu Pingyuan's younger brother.

42:37.110 --> 42:38.070
Tell me,

42:38.590 --> 42:39.360
what do you mean

42:39.360 --> 42:41.220
by your brother has gone missing?

42:43.320 --> 42:44.180
Your Highness,

42:44.880 --> 42:47.010
it's all because of my useless cousin.

42:47.030 --> 42:49.030
He went by carriage to pick up Mr. Gu,

42:49.110 --> 42:49.710
but

42:50.070 --> 42:51.960
somehow along the way,

42:52.030 --> 42:53.590
he was rendered unconscious.

42:53.590 --> 42:54.670
After he woke up,

42:54.760 --> 42:56.360
he went to Mr. Gu's room

42:56.400 --> 42:58.230
and was told Mr. Gu had been taken away.

42:58.230 --> 42:59.870
As of now, we still don't know

43:00.070 --> 43:01.550
Mr. Gu's whereabouts, Your Highness.
